  productSellerHint:["Karik ita hili loja ida, produtu ne'e sai loja ne'e nian: pájina produtu hatudu \"Fa'an husi\", no faan-sasán tama ba sira-nia konta.","Se escolher uma loja, o produto passa a ser dela: a página mostra \"Vendido por\" e as vendas entram na conta dessa loja.","Pick a store and the product becomes theirs: the page shows \"Sold by\", and the sale counts towards that store's own figures.","Pilih sebuah toko dan produk menjadi milik mereka: halaman menampilkan \"Dijual oleh\", dan penjualannya dihitung ke angka toko tersebut."],
