  retHint:["Hili saida mak Ita hakarak fila, no hatete tanba sá. Na'in-loja sei responde.","Escolha o que quer devolver e diga porquê. A loja responde.","Choose what you want to send back and say why. The shop will answer.","Pilih barang yang mau Anda kembalikan dan sebutkan alasannya. Toko akan menjawab."],
