  attnReturnsToAnswerHint:["Kliente husu atu fila sasán no hein Ita nia resposta. Simu ka la simu, hatete razaun.","Um cliente pediu para devolver e espera resposta. Aceite ou recuse, com um motivo.","A buyer asked to send something back and is waiting. Approve it, or decline with a reason.","Seorang pembeli minta mengembalikan barang dan sedang menunggu. Setujui, atau tolak dengan alasan."],
  attnCardsToVoid:["Kartaun kansela, osan sei iha banku","Cartão cancelado, dinheiro retido","Cancelled cards still holding money","Kartu dibatalkan yang masih menahan uang"],
  attnCardsToVoidHint:["Kansela ona maibé osan kliente nian sei iha BNCTL. Halo void ka reembolsu iha portál, depois troka pagamentu ba 'refunded'.","Cancelada, mas o dinheiro do cliente continua no BNCTL. Anule ou reembolse no portal e depois marque o pagamento como 'refunded'.","Cancelled, but the buyer's money is still at BNCTL. Void or refund it in the portal, then set the payment to 'refunded' here.","Sudah dibatalkan, tetapi uang pembeli masih di BNCTL. Batalkan atau kembalikan lewat portal, lalu setel pembayarannya menjadi 'dikembalikan' di sini."],
  attnRefundsToSettle:["Fila osan seidauk halo","Reembolsos por fazer","Refunds not yet paid","Pengembalian dana yang belum dibayar"],
  attnRefundsToSettleHint:["Kliente fila sasán ona; osan sei iha banku. Halo iha gateway.","O cliente devolveu; o dinheiro ainda está no banco. Faça-o no gateway.","The goods came back; the money is still at the bank. Do it at the gateway.","Barangnya sudah kembali; uangnya masih di bank. Lakukan di gateway."],
