  attnOrdersToConfirmHint:["Kliente hein hela. Stock sei la sai to'o Ita konfirma.","O cliente está à espera. O stock só sai depois de confirmar.","A buyer is waiting. Stock only leaves once you confirm.","Seorang pembeli sedang menunggu. Stok baru berkurang setelah Anda mengonfirmasi."],
  attnMessagesToSend:["Mensajen atu haruka","Mensagens por enviar","Messages to send","Pesan yang perlu dikirim"],
  attnMessagesToSendHint:["Kliente seidauk simu informasaun kona-ba sira-nia orden.","O cliente ainda não sabe do estado da encomenda.","The buyer has not been told where their order is.","Pembeli belum diberi tahu di mana pesanan mereka."],
