  attnPoUnpaidHint:["Osan ne'ebé Ita selu ba fornesedor.","Dinheiro que deve ao fornecedor.","Money owed to a supplier.","Uang yang terutang ke pemasok."],
  attnStockDrift:["Produtu ho stock la hanesan","Com stock que não bate","Stock counts do not match","Hitungan stok tidak cocok"],
  attnStockDriftHint:["Saldu la hanesan ho istória. Ne'e la sé mosu.","O saldo não bate com o histórico. Isto não devia acontecer.","A balance disagrees with its history. This should not happen.","Sebuah saldo tidak sesuai dengan riwayatnya. Ini seharusnya tidak terjadi."],
  reorderRules:["Regra sosa fila fali","Regras de reposição","Reorder rules","Aturan pemesanan ulang"],
  reorderRulesSummary:["Sura prosura husi loron {window} ikus. Assume entrega loron {lead} bainhira fornesedor la hatete. Rai reserva loron {safety}. Sosa kada loron {review}.","Mede a procura dos últimos {window} dias. Assume entrega em {lead} dias quando o fornecedor não indica. Guarda {safety} dias de reserva. Encomenda a cada {review} dias.","Measures demand over the last {window} days. Assumes {lead} days delivery when a supplier states none. Holds {safety} days of buffer. Orders every {review} days.","Mengukur permintaan selama {window} hari terakhir. Mengasumsikan pengiriman {lead} hari bila pemasok tidak menyebutkan. Menahan cadangan {safety} hari. Memesan setiap {review} hari."],
  reorderWindow:["Loron atu sura prosura","Dias de procura","Demand window","Jendela permintaan"],
  reorderWindowHint:["Naruk liu = kalma; badak liu = lalais hatene mudansa.","Mais longo = estável; mais curto = reage mais depressa.","Longer is steadier; shorter notices a change sooner.","Makin panjang makin stabil; makin pendek makin cepat menangkap perubahan."],
  reorderReview:["Loron entre sosa","Dias entre encomendas","Days between orders","Jarak hari antar pemesanan"],
  reorderReviewHint:["Stock tenke to'o to'o orden tuir mai to'o.","O stock tem de durar até chegar a encomenda seguinte.","Stock has to last until the order after this one arrives.","Stok harus bertahan sampai pesanan berikutnya tiba."],
