  reorderLeadHint:["Uza de'it bainhira fornesedor la hatete tempu entrega.","Usado apenas quando o fornecedor não indica prazo.","Used only for a supplier that states no lead time.","Dipakai hanya untuk pemasok yang tidak menyebutkan waktu tunggu."],
  reorderPlan:["Planu sosa fila fali","Plano de reposição","Reorder plan","Rencana pemesanan ulang"],
  reorderPlanSub:["Saida mak atu sosa, hira, no bainhira — tuir velosidade fa'an no tempu entrega.","O que comprar, quanto e quando — pela velocidade de venda e o prazo de entrega.","What to buy, how much, and when — from how fast it sells and how long delivery takes.","Apa yang dibeli, berapa banyak, dan kapan — dari secepat apa barang terjual dan selama apa pengirimannya."],
